  "p.s6c.h": "Screen Time mode",
  "p.s6c.b": "<p>Optional, and used only if you switch a reminder to Screen Time mode. In this mode ReMemo counts time only while your device is awake and unlocked, so a timer pauses when you put the phone down and resets if you stay away for two minutes.</p><p>ReMemo determines this from your device's own screen and lock state, which requires no permission. It does not read which apps you open, app names, URLs, on-screen content, or any usage history, and nothing about your activity is transmitted anywhere.</p>",
